+
+    /**
+     * Athena - takes an entity out of its bucket and out of the extents array beside it.
+     *
+     * <p>The entries after it shift down by one, so their slots are re-stamped. Buckets hold a
+     * handful of entities, and shifting rather than swapping the last entry into the hole keeps
+     * the order queries see - which is the order collisions are resolved in.
